"argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Sorry, Argent. Hayne showed up already, but we defeated him and he's run off again. As you can see, though, Durand has quite a large ambush waiting for us. So welcome to the party.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "Man, I hate you guys.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "But hey, for a new chapter in the saga of how much I rule, I put together a new prototype on my journey back. Check out the blue prints for my new flier, the Vulture Drone. I know what you're going to say. I think I'm sexy and intelligent, too.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": true}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Durand hides himself again.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "He's preparing a final assault. I know him. It's his style.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Good. Soon we will crush Durand and restore our place on this continent.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN TUCKER", "message": "Peace will be a welcome change.", "avatar": "tucker", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "CAPTAIN ARGENT", "message": "And then maybe I can take that vacation I keep getting promised.", "avatar": "argent", "color": "FFFF0000"}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Yes, then you can exercise some of that flab to be more useful in future ambushes.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}, {"conditions": [{"type": "endGame", "player": 1, "victory": false}], "responses": [{"type": "disableControllers", "disable": true}, {"type": "chat", "sender": "COMMANDER YURIK", "message": "Our troops were not strong enough. What did we fail to instill in them? What lessons did we not teach? It does not matter now, though. We can never return home.", "avatar": "yurik", "color": "FF00FF00"}, {"type": "disableControllers", "disable": false}]}]}}